    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Dissolve above in 80 ml of water and adjust to pH 7.8. Bring to 90 ml with water. Autoclave and cool to room temperature. Add the following under sterile conditions: Schneider's Drosophila medium (Invitorogen, Gibco) 160 ml, Fetal bovine serum (heat-inactivated) 50 ml, Penicillin G (100,000 U/ml) 2.5 ml."
